# November 22, 2026: Watertown and southern Jefferson County, New York (Adams, Henderson, Hounsfield, Ellisburg).
# Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region nny, which offered Adams); the Atlas had one place in Watertown
# (the Paddock Arcade) and the roundhouse ruins, and nothing within 15 km of Adams. Sources opened in this session:
# Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), HMdb marker pages and nearby lists, the Norton-Burnham House Register form and
# the Hounsfield Multiple Resource Area form (NPGallery text), historypointer.com Register summaries, the Jefferson County
# Historical Society's pages, the City of Watertown's library and parks pages and its 2023 Thompson Park Master Plan, the
# National Park Service and the Cultural Landscape Foundation on Thompson Park, the Preservation League of New York State
# and TAUNY on Thomas Memorial church, 6sqft on the Taylor mansion, and the Village of Adams history page, through
# tools/page.py. The other Register forms for Watertown and Adams came back as NPGallery placeholders and were not read.
